{"suttaId":"thag1.94","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[546,549],"vripara":"94"},"segments":{"thag1.94:0.4":"Mettajittheragāthā","thag1.94:1.1":"“Namo hi tassa bhagavato, sakyaputtassa sirīmato;","thag1.94:1.3":"Tenāyaṃ aggappattena, aggadhammo [aggo dhammo (sī.)] sudesito”ti.","thag1.94:1.5":"… Mettaji thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":2382,"to":2382,"paras":[{"para":2382,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag1.94:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>namo</b>ti namakkāro.","<b>Hī</b>ti nipātamattaṃ.","<b>Tassā</b>ti yo so bhagavā samattiṃsapāramiyo pūretvā sabbakilese bhañjitvā anuttaraṃ sammāsambodhiṃ abhisambuddho, sakyarājassa puttoti <b>sakyaputto</b>.","Anaññasādhāraṇāya puññasampattiyā ca sambhāvito uttamāya rūpakāyasiriyā dhammakāyasiriyā ca samannāgatattā <b>sirīmā,</b> tassa bhagavato sakyaputtassa sirīmato namo atthu, taṃ namāmīti attho.","<b>Tenā</b>ti tena bhagavatā.","<b>Ayan</b>ti tassa dhammassa attano paccakkhatāya vadati.","<b>Aggappattenā</b>ti aggaṃ sabbaññutaṃ, sabbehi vā guṇehi aggabhāvaṃ seṭṭhabhāvaṃ pattena.","<b>Aggadhammo</b>ti aggo uttamo navavidhalokuttaro dhammo suṭṭhu aviparītaṃ <b>desito</b> paveditoti."],"lineRefs":[["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.94:1.1","namo",0,0],["thag1.94:1.1","hī",0,1],["thag1.94:1.1","sakyaputto",0,2],["thag1.94:1.1","tassā",0,2],["thag1.94:1.1","sirīmā",0,3],["thag1.94:1.3","tenā",0,4],["thag1.94:1.3","aggappattenā",0,6],["thag1.94:1.3","aggadhammo",0,7],["thag1.94:1.3","desito",0,7]],"before":[{"para":2364,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Erakattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2365,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2366,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Namo hi tassa bhagavato</b>ti āyasmato mettajittherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","So kira anomadassissa bhagavato kāle kulagehe nibbattitvā viññutaṃ patto sāsane abhippasanno hutvā bodhirukkhassa iṭṭhakāhi vedikaṃ cinitvā sudhāparikammaṃ kāresi.","Satthā tassa anumodanaṃ akāsi.","So tena puññakammena devaloke nibbattitvā aparāparaṃ puññāni katvā devamanussesu saṃsaranto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde magadharaṭṭhe aññatarassa brāhmaṇassa putto hutvā nibbatti, <b>mettajī</b>tissa nāmaṃ ahosi.","So vayappatto kāmesu ādīnavaṃ disvā tāpasapabbajjaṃ pabbajitvā araññe viharanto buddhuppādaṃ sutvā pubbahetunā codiyamāno satthu santikaṃ gantvā pavattinivattiyo ārabbha pañhaṃ pucchitvā satthārā pañhe vissajjite paṭiladdhasaddho pabbajitvā vipassanaṃ paṭṭhapetvā arahattaṃ pāpuṇi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 1.15.26-31)–"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":2367,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Anomadassīmunino, bodhivedimakāsahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2368,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sudhāya piṇḍaṃ datvāna, pāṇikammaṃ akāsahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2369,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Disvā taṃ sukataṃ kammaṃ, anomadassī naruttamo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2370,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Bhikkhusaṅghe ṭhito satthā, imā gāthā abhāsatha."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2371,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Iminā sudhakammena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2372,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna, dukkhassantaṃ karissati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2373,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pasannamukhavaṇṇomhi, ekaggo susamāhito;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2374,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2375,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ito kappasate āsiṃ, paripuṇṇe anūnake;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2376,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Rājā sabbaghano nāma, cakkavattī mahabbalo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2377,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2378,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Arahattaṃ pana patvā satthāraṃ thomento –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2380,"vripara":"94","refs":[],"lines":["“Namo hi tassa bhagavato, sakyaputtassa sirīmato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2381,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tenāyaṃ aggappattena, aggadhammo sudesito”ti.","– gāthaṃ abhāsi;"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
